# The repo is edited on Windows but built and read on Linux and macOS too, and it had
# drifted into a mix of LF and CRLF - sometimes within one file. That turned one-line
# changes into hundred-line diffs. Everything text is LF in the repository from here on.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must not touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.bin binary
*.ico binary
*.wad binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# This one is read on a Windows PC straight off the watch's storage, so it keeps
# Windows line endings (it is embedded in the firmware byte for byte).
themes/README.txt text eol=crlf
